        "description": "We used AI to complete 10x more high-impact work with the same team. But the difference was not the tool. It was the operating model.\n\nMost companies use AI as a personal productivity layer for leadership. A few people get faster, but the company still depends on leadership for prompts, workflows, context, and direction.\n\nIn this video, Hayden Miyamoto breaks down what changes when a company moves from an AI-assisted bottleneck to an AI-Assisted Team: shared reality, shared operating system, better workflows, clearer priorities, and a practical path for scaling AI across the whole team.\n\n*Run the free AI Audit here:*\nhttps://empowerlabs.ai/ai-audit\n\n*You’ll learn:*\n- Why AI often makes leaders faster without making the company faster\n- What an AI-Assisted Team actually looks like\n- How shared context changes the way people and AI work\n- The operating model behind 10x more high-impact work\n- A practical framework for finding better AI opportunities inside your company\n\n*Chapters:*\n0:00 The 10x shift\n0:35 The AI-assisted bottleneck\n1:06 What an AI-Assisted Team means\n1:39 What good looks like\n2:16 Proof from real teams\n3:01 The five-step framework\n3:47 Where to start",
